5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I’d like to look into the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster to see who is actually available.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I’ll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the structural survey of the suspended bay.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I’ll pull the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips. I want to see what actually draws people back, not just what looks good on paper.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’ll look into the maintenance log for powered displays and the evening hire bookings. I need to know what the room can physically handle.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, mystery time! I’ll check the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges. I bet the money is hiding in the boxes!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Shion, your shipping concerns are wise. May, I hope the visitor records show what truly matters to our guests.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I appreciate the sentiment, Shizue. But sentiment doesn't stop a crate from arriving late. I need hard data on where the logistics actually failed.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, hard data is lovely, but people don’t return for logistics. They return for the experience. I’m just checking if the numbers agree with my gut.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I’m not arguing with the data, Shion. I’m just checking if the floor can hold what the data promises.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, if the crates are late, the money is definitely hiding in the boxes! I’ll find out where it went.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we are all looking at different pieces of the puzzle. It helps to see the whole picture.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Shizue, a puzzle is just a collection of missing pieces. I am looking for the cracks in the foundation, not the decorative frame.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, cracks are boring. I’m hunting for the heartbeat. If the numbers don’t sing, I’m not interested.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"The floor doesn’t sing, Shion. It just holds. I’m checking if it can hold what we promise.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Misaki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Misaki: The floor doesn’t sing, Shion. It just holds. I’m checking if it can hold what we promise.""}]}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, cracks are just where the money leaks out! I’ll find the holes before the invoices do.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Shion, your caution is well placed. May, I trust your instincts. Misaki, the building must be safe. Sakura, your curiosity is welcome.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May"",""Misaki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Shizue, caution is not a virtue; it is a necessity. I will not apologize for expecting the worst.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"@Shion, expecting the worst is just pessimism with a tie. I’m expecting the best, and I’ll prove it with the numbers.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"The building doesn’t care about your tie, Shion. It only cares about weight. I’ll see what the floor can actually take.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Misaki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Misaki: The building doesn’t care about your tie, Shion. It only cares about weight. I’ll see what the floor can actually take.""}]}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, I’ll find the money holes! @Shizue, thanks for the warm welcome!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
