35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The lab is down to one person with two hundred pieces waiting. The volunteers are mostly busy with history walks. Who will actually stand in the room?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Two openings slipped because paperwork arrived late. The bay holds four hundred kilos. We need to know if the candidates fit those limits before we promise anything.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"@Shizue, the numbers are singing! People come back for people, not just objects. We need a show with live action.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Seventeen call-outs last season, four during opening hours. Plus six evenings lost to caterers. The room is already overworked.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, your late crates cost a third of our installation budget! And the joiner’s rate jumped! We need self-supporting objects to save cash!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, you are right. People need people. But with only one conservator and busy volunteers, who will actually be there to talk to them?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, a third of the budget is a leak, not a mystery. I need to know if the candidates respect the four-hundred-kilo limit before we discuss costs.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, that is the real problem. If we pick a show needing live demos, we are stuck. We need something that works without a crowd of staff.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, live action means more moving parts. More parts mean more call-outs. I am worried about the maintenance burden, not the charm.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, moving parts are expensive! But @May, people love people! Maybe we pick something sturdy that doesn’t need a mechanic?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, you are right to worry. With so few hands, we must choose a show that does not break.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, the bay’s limit is absolute. If the weight exceeds four hundred kilos, the floor fails. I will not gamble on shoring.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I hear you. But if the room is empty, the numbers drop. We need a balance.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the weight limit is a hard stop. @May, I agree on the balance. We need something that stays put and doesn’t need constant fixing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, sturdy means no crating fees! @May, if it’s heavy, it stays put! I’m voting for the heavy stuff!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the two hundred pieces waiting. We cannot add more work to one tired person. We must choose wisely.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I will not gamble on shoring. The bay’s limit is absolute. If the weight exceeds four hundred kilos, the floor fails.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Shizue, I hear you. We need presence without the staff drain. A show where the objects speak, but the room feels alive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,The room is already overworked. I need a show that stays put and doesn’t need constant fixing.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Shizue, I promise to find the money holes! @May, let’s pick something sturdy so the floor doesn’t grumble!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
